<title>TAIWAN: Cathay Life Jan-Sept pretax up 5.4 pct.</title>
<headline>Cathay Life Jan-Sept pretax up 5.4 pct.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-29</dateline>
<text>
<p>January-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover			    174,691 vs 162,774</p>
<p>    Pretax profit			 9,923 vs   9,416</p>
<p>    Net profit			    8,198 vs   8,047</p>
<p>NOTE - Cathay Life Insurance Company is Taiwan's largest insurance company.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (5080815)</p>
</text>
